@startuml 02-auth-user
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 120
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #37474F
  ArrowColor #455A64
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam stereotypeCBackgroundColor #90CAF9
title Auth & User — Class Diagram

package "auth" #E3F2FD {
  class AuthController <<Controller>> {
    - authService : AuthService
    + register(input : RegisterDTO) : AuthResult
    + login(email : string, password : string) : AuthResult
    + logout(userId : string, refreshToken : string) : void
  }
  class AuthService <<Service>> {
    - userRepository : UserRepository
    - jwtConfig : JwtConfig
    + register(input : RegisterDTO) : AuthResult
    + login(email : string, password : string) : AuthResult
    + logout(userId : string, refreshToken : string) : void
  }
}

package "user" #E8EAF6 {
  class UserController <<Controller>> {
    - userService : UserService
    + changePassword(userId : string, old : string, newPwd : string) : boolean
    + updateProfile(userId : string, input : UpdateProfileDTO) : UserDTO
  }
  class UserService <<Service>> {
    - userRepository : UserRepository
    + changePassword(userId : string, old : string, newPwd : string) : boolean
    + updateProfile(userId : string, input : UpdateProfileDTO) : UserDTO
  }
  class UserRepository <<Repository>> {
    - prisma : PrismaClient
    + findUserByEmail(email : string) : User
    + findUserById(id : string) : User
    + createUser(data : CreateUserData) : User
    + updateUser(userId : string, data : UpdateUserData) : User
    + incrementTokenVersion(userId : string) : User
  }
}

class User <<Entity>> {
  - id : string
  - email : string
  - passwordHash : string
  - name : string
  - avatar : string
  - systemRole : SystemRole
  - tokenVersion : int
  - isSuspended : boolean
}

AuthController --> AuthService
UserController --> UserService
AuthService ..> UserRepository
UserService ..> UserRepository
UserRepository ..> User

note bottom of UserRepository
  **Sua so voi so do goc**: bo revokeRefreshToken() /
  revokeAllRefreshTokens() (khong co bang refresh_tokens).
  Theo architecture.md muc 2.4 -> dung incrementTokenVersion()
  dua tren User.tokenVersion.
end note

note bottom of User
  **D2**: `Post` them `createdById` (FK users, `SetNull`).
  Tham so truyen vao service van goi `creatorId` (lay tu JWT)
  va map thang vao `createdById`.
end note
@enduml
